      "text": "Predeclared action and doses: normal starts one trolley carrying B4-B7 at 0, unloads at 3, then hands B8-B12 consecutively from 3 through 8. Higher dose additionally replaces the B8 hand trip with a singleton trolley from 3 through 6, then hands B9-B12 from 6 through 10. Inspection starts every eligible next carrier immediately. Predicted outcomes are respectively twelve correct releases by 13 with eight versus ten occupied transfer minutes. This tests marginal underfilled trolley use."
