        "R8"
      ],
      "text": "Fix two independently reset matched trial pairs with identical initial demand and schedules above. Record unload identities, correct releases by 13, occupied intervals, occupancy, waits and charge. Exact goal metric: completing twelve correct releases by 13 outranks failure; among complete successes, fewer occupied transfer minutes wins. Failures against failures are unordered. Reset availability is an explicitly untestable assumption under supplied resources."
    },
    {
