      ],
      "text": "Switch only if BOTH higher-dose trials worsen that fixed metric relative to their normal-dose controls. Otherwise hold the normal regime; missing trials cannot establish the trigger. Declared dependency-free route: hand B4-B12 consecutively from 0 through 9, inspecting immediately throughout; prediction is twelve correct releases by 13 and nine occupied transfer minutes. It uses no powered trolley. Defeat: either complete higher-dose trial ties or beats its control, or the hand route fails complete release. Clerks retain separate roles; hand exit predicts one extra transfer minute versus normal."
    }
